Significant Problems


All Altair Filter houses have been rejected due to manifold welds not meeting specifications.  GE is working with it supplier to provide a plan for corrective measures.  GE is in progress of providing Enron with a corrective plan.  Initial plan will be provided to Enron on November 17.
The amount of customer required unit shipments during the months, November through March will impact GE ability to ship units at late request.  Enron should consider and provide best known required shipment dates in order to arrange shipment slots early.




